1046 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Key responsibilities\072\nMonitored and investigated security alerts using FortiSIEM and ArcSight\054 making sure critical issues were picked up and escalated on time\056\nHandled incidents end\055to\055end\054 from initial triage to containment\054 remediation\054 and recovery\056\nWorked on threat hunting across FortiSIEM\054 Splunk\054 and Elastic\054 helping identify hidden threats and mapping them to MITRE Attack\056\nBuilt and improved detection rules\054 and correlated logs across endpoint\054 network\054 and email sources to reduce false positives and improve visibility\056\nUsed threat intelligence and OSINT during investigations to add more context and support proactive detection\056\nDocumented investigation steps\054 playbooks\054 and incident findings so the team could reuse and improve processes\056\nWorked closely with IT and network teams during incidents to make sure issues were contained and resolved properly\056\nAnalyzed malware using SentinelOne and Elastic Defend\054 focusing on understanding behavior and improving detection\056\nInvestigated phishing and malware emails\054 including header and payload analysis\054 and helped with remediation\056\nPerformed host\055level investigations\054 including root cause analysis\054 system cleanup\054 reimaging\054 and basic forensic analysis\056\nCollaborated with the Red Team during Nessus assessments to validate findings and fix vulnerabilities\056\nAutomated some routine SOC tasks using XOAR\054 and supported ISO 27001 activities along with SOC reporting\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 1047 0 R
     /Pg 1026 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

